            "review_title": "Review at Ember Dine & Wine",
            "review_text": "Victor H\n4 contributions\n0\nGreat Food!\nMay 2026 • Solo\nIt was near to where I work. The moment I step in, I was attracted by the setup, the transparency between me and the cook. I tasted the wagyu beef noodles and I was attracted by the tenderness of the noodles as well as the beef. It was one of the best noodle I can find in Ho Chi Minh that suits my taste buds. I returned again for dinner… this time I ordered the prawn + the wagyu beef noodles again, surprising finding consistency of taste, tenderness of the noodles and beef. I would definitely come back again when I touch down in Ho Chi Minh again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 22, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
